        "body": "A Convert **dictates the FC in front of it** (← ← arrows, dropdown locked to `m`) so the value is tagged in the unit it reads. Its `toUnit` rides the value out — the result shows **yards** with no trailing FC. Feed it a value in the wrong DIMENSION (a `$`) and it refuses with `#UNIT!` — primacy or an error, never a silent pass.",
